    "Stored raw RGB fails ZBar; JPEG quality100/95/90 also fail,85/75/60 pass for both RGB and grayscale JPEG.",
    "Scan density, resizing, color channels, posterization, crop, contrast, global threshold and tested box-adaptive thresholds did not decode the stored frame.",
