    "Fresh batch138: all six tested variants0/6; batch140: all six variants0/4. Quality75 is not a universal fix.",
    "ZXing3.1.1 decoded the four identical raw batch140 PNGs on desktop: LocalAverage4/4,GlobalHistogram0/4,FixedThreshold0/4.",
    "This isolates a useful decoder/binarization lead. It does not prove the ISP image is optimal or explain every ZBar internal failure."
